	*               min function in FORTRAN.  NaN arguments are treated as missing  *
	*               data.  If one argument is NaN and the other is a number, then   *
	*               the number is returned.  If both are NaNs then the first        *
	*               argument is returned.                                           *
	*                                                                               *
	*******************************************************************************	}
