 *      command ID.
 *    
 *    outIndex:
 *      On exit, the item index of the menu item with the specified
 *      command ID.
 *  
 *  Availability:
 *    Non-Carbon CFM:   not available
 *    CarbonLib:        in CarbonLib 1.0 and later
 *    Mac OS X:         in version 10.0 or later
 }
