    MPAllocate                  (Deprecated, use MPAllocateAligned for new builds.)
    MPFree
    MPBlockCopy
    MPLibraryIsLoaded           (In C only, a macro.)
    _MPIsFullyInitialized       (See comments about checking for MP API availability.)
   ===========================================================================================
}


