 *  Result:
 *    A status code
 *  
 *  Availability:
 *    Non-Carbon CFM:   not available
 *    CarbonLib:        in CarbonLib 1.1 and later
 *    Mac OS X:         in version 10.0 or later
 }
FUNCTION NavDialogGetReply(inDialog: NavDialogRef; VAR outReply: NavReplyRecord): OSStatus; C;


